5 graduates landed jobs at 192 unique employers across 36 states. 97% Placement for AY25 BS grads with internship experience 82% Placement for AY25 BS grads without internship experience $76,805 Average Starting Salary Related Links Career Fair Career Guide Data Internships and Co-ops About Us There’s a reason our students are in high demand. Through our expansive internship\n                                 program, one-on-one interview prep and resume review, and year-round workshops and\n                                 events, we won’t just help you hit the ground running. We’ll give you a competitive\n                                 edge. Whether you are a student, alumnus, or employer, we want to connect you to the people\n                                 and places you need to succeed. Email us to make an appointment today. Rebecca Monahan Career Services Director Devereaux Library, 214 rebecca.monahan@sdsmt.edu Madi Fuegen Сareer Services Coordinator Devereaux Library, 209 madison.fuegen@sdsmt.edu Contact Career Services Located in the Devereaux Library (Main Floor - Offices 209 & 214) Hours: 7:30 AM - 4:30 PM, Mon. - Fri. Summer Hours: 7:30 AM - 4:00 PM (605) 394-2667 careerservices@sdsmt.edu back to top 501 E. Saint Joseph St. Rapid City, SD 57701 (605) 394-2511 admissions@sdsmt.edu Consumer Information Directory Careers at Mines Campus Map Sustainability © South Dakota Mines Site design by iFactory ©"
